@startuml
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
title Idempotency V1 - 状态生命周期

state "ABSENT\n(no record)" as ABSENT
state "PROCESSING\nownerToken\nversion\nprocessingExpireAt" as PROCESSING
state "SUCCESS\ncompleted\noptional resultPayload" as SUCCESS
state "FAILED\nfailureCode\nfailureRetryable" as FAILED

[*] --> ABSENT
ABSENT --> PROCESSING : tryAcquire\nowner=A, version=1
PROCESSING --> SUCCESS : callback success\nmarkSuccess(owner, version)
PROCESSING --> FAILED : callback failure\nmarkFailed(owner, version)
PROCESSING --> FAILED : processingExpireAt <= now\nPROCESSING_TIMEOUT
FAILED --> PROCESSING : retryable && retry enabled\nnewOwner, version+1
SUCCESS --> SUCCESS : duplicate request\nREPLAYED
PROCESSING --> PROCESSING : duplicate before timeout\nPROCESSING
FAILED --> FAILED : retry disabled / non-retryable\nPREVIOUS_FAILED
SUCCESS --> ABSENT : SHORT_TERM recordTtl expires
FAILED --> ABSENT : SHORT_TERM recordTtl expires

note right of PROCESSING
processingTimeout 是执行权租约，
不是 record TTL。
end note

note right of SUCCESS
DURABLE 不依赖 TTL 自动删除；
SHORT_TERM TTL 到期后可再次执行。
end note
@enduml
